/* ---------- 底部输入栏：千禧银粉闪耀蕾丝星链硬件抽屉（#161618 + #EAE9E5 + #C6CBC5 + #E06389） ---------- */
body.pcc-chat-visible #chat-window-view .chat-input-area {
  position: relative !important;
  z-index: 9 !important;
  display: flex !important;
  flex-direction: column !important;
  padding: 15px 0 calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)) !important;
  background-color: #161618 !important;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(224, 99, 137, .24) 0%, rgba(22, 22, 24, 0) 58%),
    url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 width=%2710%27 height=%2710%27 viewBox=%270 0 10 10%27%3E%3Ccircle cx=%272%27 cy=%272%27 r=%271.1%27 fill=%27%23EAE9E5%27 fill-opacity=%270.14%27/%3E%3Ccircle cx=%277%27 cy=%277%27 r=%270.9%27 fill=%27%23E06389%27 fill-opacity=%270.22%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E"),
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(28, 28, 33, .97) 0%, rgba(18, 18, 21, .99) 100%) !important;
  background-size: 100% 100%, 10px 10px, 100% 100% !important;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(234, 233, 229, .34) !important;
  border-radius: 26px 26px 0 0 !important;
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .18),
    0 -10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, .58),
    0 -2px 16px rgba(224, 99, 137, .16) !important;
  backdrop-filter: blur(16px) !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) !important;
  overflow: visible !important;
}
/* 顶沿蕾丝花边压边（在居中星链扣饰处优雅让位） */
body.pcc-chat-visible #chat-window-view .chat-input-area::after {
  content: '' !important;
  display: block !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  top: -7px !important;
  left: 22px !important;
  right: 22px !important;
  height: 8px !important;
  background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 width=%2724%27 height=%278%27 viewBox=%270 0 24 8%27%3E%3Cpath d=%27M0 7c3 0 3-5.5 6-5.5S9 7 12 7s3-5.5 6-5.5S21 7 24 7%27 fill=%27rgba(234,233,229,0.08)%27 stroke=%27%23EAE9E5%27 stroke-opacity=%270.62%27 stroke-width=%271%27/%3E%3Ccircle cx=%276%27 cy=%274.4%27 r=%270.95%27 fill=%27%23E06389%27/%3E%3Ccircle cx=%2718%27 cy=%274.4%27 r=%270.95%27 fill=%27%23E06389%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E") repeat-x center bottom / 24px 8px !important;
  -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #000 0%, #000 24%, transparent 33%, transparent 67%, #000 76%, #000 100%) !important;
  mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #000 0%, #000 24%, transparent 33%, transparent 67%, #000 76%, #000 100%) !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  z-index: 2 !important;
}
/* 抽屉顶部居中：银锁链 + 中空嵌套实心粉星 + 双侧高亮四角闪光 */
body.pcc-chat-visible #chat-window-view .chat-input-area::before {
  content: '' !important;
  display: block !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  top: -7px !important;
  left: 50% !important;
  width: 180px !important;
  height: 16px !important;
  transform: translateX(-50%) !important;
  background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 width=%27180%27 height=%2716%27 viewBox=%270 0 180 16%27%3E%3Cpath d=%27M4 8h48M128 8h48%27 stroke=%27%23EAE9E5%27 stroke-opacity=%270.45%27 stroke-width=%270.9%27 stroke-linecap=%27round%27/%3E%3Crect x=%2755%27 y=%275.5%27 width=%2711%27 height=%275%27 rx=%272.5%27 fill=%27none%27 stroke=%27%23EAE9E5%27 stroke-opacity=%270.72%27 stroke-width=%271.05%27/%3E%3Crect x=%27114%27 y=%275.5%27 width=%2711%27 height=%275%27 rx=%272.5%27 fill=%27none%27 stroke=%27%23EAE9E5%27 stroke-opacity=%270.72%27 stroke-width=%271.05%27/%3E%3Cpath d=%27M66 8h10M104 8h10%27 stroke=%27%23E06389%27 stroke-width=%271.25%27 stroke-linecap=%27round%27/%3E%3Cpolygon points=%2790,1.2 92.1,5.6 97,6.2 93.4,9.4 94.3,14.2 90,11.9 85.7,14.2 86.6,9.4 83,6.2 87.9,5.6%27 fill=%27none%27 stroke=%27%23EAE9E5%27 stroke-width=%271.15%27 stroke-linejoin=%27round%27/%3E%3Cpolygon points=%2790,4.6 91,6.8 93.4,7.1 91.6,8.7 92.1,11.1 90,9.9 87.9,11.1 88.4,8.7 86.6,7.1 89,6.8%27 fill=%27%23E06389%27/%3E%3Cpath d=%27M77 4.2l.8 2.6L80.4 7.6l-2.6.8-.8 2.6-.8-2.6-2.6-.8 2.6-.8z%27 fill=%27%23FFFFFF%27/%3E%3Cpath d=%27M103 4.2l.8 2.6L106.4 7.6l-2.6.8-.8 2.6-.8-2.6-2.6-.8 2.6-.8z%27 fill=%27%23FFFFFF%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E") center / contain no-repeat !important;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(224, 99, 137, .45)) !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  z-index: 3 !important;
}
body.chat-keyboard-resizing #chat-window-view .chat-input-area {
  backdrop-filter: none !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
}
/* 引用回复提示条 */
body.pcc-chat-visible #chat-window-view #reply-indicator {
  order: 0 !important;
  margin: 0 12px 6px !important;
  padding: 6px 12px !important;
